KXrzqAl14ecQ7kNvwGEF1Ae&_nc_oc=AdpjqC3NIWDlMGYHV5Y6fIwdOaIyC4PAvGxJxVPaSLQwv6xCgvgTUqHuCU1cJ23ApS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy5TfG3o5hZwgKxuvYvHckytaoVPWw4JzoiCMO5cdSeUA&oe=69C3EDB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gC3SxmI84h8Q7kNvwHTXfBt&_nc_oc=AdqOdtoLfOejs6uDeNbyITGoKSddLxsJ7mh72cjrwSpXlhtUyfdxKPyCe6PXs5l-_R4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwGnARI6zR5N8uFmI4BQxd21oVQSOXdc-OEendC003mHg&oe=69C3EF4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NIM0kxd_x-8Q7kNvwFh7g2L&_nc_oc=AdrGoKTNoc-gTIw2-f4DkVpiXrsRZDMpN5dmW55ymRCElrxgz1STyc8kUtKVxkVSGJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwux5FgtqD9kdO5YC-qhjlghxx8jze_7Hpeaqb_2nLnJg&oe=69C3DC6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlIfWxrxsoMQ7kNvwGkJt0R&_nc_oc=Adq5CScrxnccL6OgUX51wPfpM-tZNjB1XlpeGg3L2i3PchmycoqO16jzIj_Rf6emyuM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw6zIlPbEw3h9EKbSqy9nCGDk_Fj84sdxeFMotCLeOVNg&oe=69C3C5C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H6a4x6C0WP8Q7kNvwE5InBX&_nc_oc=AdoNztORh12iokwm3ajiXGXotjlzvcGuHxZvy406WZSP3DFZaZgCLVsJYoVvvBhAetg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw8kU8gswBPW_gfo-ATX7xKSMYZCLaupyz9igIY7XsEag&oe=69C3BE18"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mVHbaj7jTnIQ7kNvwGTFhHm&_nc_oc=AdonLj4taFCyAfzgq0sxHCnNa3PToEQOuXRxrcOMXoHjiUCm8knCKXlnCk7sFyUbEf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwaB-SBNL54bcvrNRxa-O5rAqVAqSOWn92f70Z9AWBf2Q&oe=69C3D13C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080